ildlife photography, National Geographic style, aspect ratio 4:3, an adult cheetah crouching low on African savanna. Sleek streamlined body, short dense warm tawny-brown fur covered with solid round black spots, distinctive black tear stripes stretching from inner eye corners down to mouth, clear amber eyes. Taut muscle contours, matte short plush fur texture, thick powerful paws. The cheetah supports its body with front legs, muscles coiled, head raised and gaze alertly staring into distance, holding a breath to observe prey, full of hidden explosive power. Tall golden dry grass all around, scattered solitary acacia trees on the distant horizon, pale blue cloudy sky. Rule of thirds composition, cheetah placed on left third of frame. Foreground grass blades slightly blurred, soft blurred background, shallow depth of field to highlight the cheetah. Golden hour side backlight, low warm sun creates delicate rim light along cheetah’s back. Warm golden main light contrasting with cool tone background, rich light and shadow layers, long shadow cast on ground, tiny dust particles floating in air. Shot on Nikon Z9, 400mm f/2.8 telephoto lens, sharp focus on cheetah face and fur, natural film grain, ultra-detailed fur texture, natural color, cinematic atmosphere, open wild savanna space, no text, no logos, no watermarks, high dynamic range, authentic wild animal portrait."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [28], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [397.5469970703125, 109.37515258789062], "pos": [-798.3511352539062, 3290.901611328125], "widgets_values": [1200, 1600, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localiz